{{Dialogue|Cham Syndulla|The Imperials now occupy the entire Tann province.|Ezra Bridger|What's the Tann province?|Kanan Jarrus|It's where Hera grew up.|attr=Cham Syndulla, [[Ezra Bridger]], and [[Kanan Jarrus]]|src=<ref name="HH" />}}
The '''Tann Province''', also known simply as '''Tann''', was located on the [[planet]] [[Ryloth]]. The [[Twi'lek]] [[Hera Syndulla]] grew up in the province in her [[Syndulla residence|home]], along with her father, [[General]] [[Cham Syndulla]], and her mother, [[Eleni Syndulla]].<ref name="HH" />

==History==
===Clone Wars===
{{Quote|That Y-wing crashed here back in the Clone War, and my father left it as a memorial. It also happens to be the ship I pulled Chopper out of, so he still has issues with it.|Hera Syndulla|<ref name="HH" />}}
During the [[Clone Wars]]' [[Ryloth]] [[Battle of Ryloth|Campaign]], a [[Galactic Republic|Republic]] [[BTL-A4 Y-wing assault starfighter/bomber|Y-wing bomber]] crashed in the province. It was there that [[Twi'lek Resistance]]<ref name="HH" /> [[General]] [[Cham Syndulla]]'s daughter [[Hera Syndulla|Hera]] found the [[BTL Y-wing starfighter|Y-wing's]] [[Astromech droid|astromech]], [[C1-10P]], pulled him out, and repaired him.<ref name="Homecoming">{{Rebels|Homecoming}}</ref> After the War, Cham left the Y-wing as a memorial outside of his [[Syndulla residence|home]].<ref name="HH" />

===Imperial Era===
{{Quote|But then the province fell and the galaxy kept turning. The FRM needed me back on Ryloth to help liberate Tann and so I kept it moving.|Kaasha Bateen|<ref name="Last Shot">''[[Last Shot]]''</ref>}}
[[File:Syndulla_home_outside.png|thumb|right|200px|The Syndulla's home was converted into an Imperial base.]]
When [[Captain]] [[Slavin]]'s clumsy attacks failed, [[Grand Admiral|Grand]] [[Admiral]] [[Mitth'raw'nuruodo|Thrawn]] was able to force Syndulla to abandon the Tann province. Slavin and his [[Imperial Military|forces]] then turned Syndulla's home into an Imperial headquarters.<ref name="HH" />

Sometime later, the tactician and Twi'lek resistance fighter [[Kaasha Bateen]] was recalled from her [[time]] on [[Pasa Novo]] during the [[Pasa Novo campaign]] so she could help the [[Free Ryloth Movement]] liberate Tann.<ref name="Last Shot" />

